## If? Then! Else? {data-background-image="./_extensions/emc/www/triangle1.svg" data-background-size="contain" data-background-position="top left"}

Conditional execution:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
if (condition) {
  statement1
}
```
:::


or


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
if (condition) {
  statement1
} else {
  statement2
}
```
:::


## Example {data-background-image="./_extensions/emc/www/triangle1.svg" data-background-size="contain" data-background-position="top left"}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
x <- 5
if (x < 10) {
  y <- 0
}
y
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0
```


:::
:::


Another example:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
if (x >= 10) {
  y <- 1
} else {
  y <- 0
}
y
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] 0
```


:::
:::


