## Stringing multiple if else together {data-background-image="./_extensions/emc/www/triangle1.svg" data-background-size="contain" data-background-position="top left"}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
whatAnimalSound <- function(animal){
  if(animal == "cat") {
    return("Meow!")
  } else if (animal == "frog") {
    return("Ribbit!")
  } else if (animal == "dog") {
    return("Woof!")
  } else {
    return(paste0("I don't know what sound a '",animal,"' makes..."))
  }
}
```
:::



::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
whatAnimalSound("dog")
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
[1] "Woof!"
```


:::

```{.r .cell-code}
whatAnimalSound("bird")
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
